### 1. Payment Intent Tests

### Create Payment Intent
POST http://localhost:8086/lms/v1/stripe/create-payment-intent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 2000,
  "currency": "usd",
  "description": "Test Payment",
  "customer_id": "cus_SiERLo5uiJIqGq",
  "metadata": {
    "order_id": "12345"
  }
}

### Get Payment Status
GET http://localhost:8086/lms/v1/stripe/payment-status?payment_intent_id=pi_3RmnyxInsa2xt1880mD1v44t

### Test Invalid Amount
POST http://localhost:8086/lms/v1/stripe/create-payment-intent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 0,
  "currency": "usd",
  "description": "Invalid Amount Test"
}

### 2. Checkout Session Tests

### Create Checkout Session
POST http://localhost:8086/lms/v1/stripe/create-checkout-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 2000,
  "currency": "usd",
  "product_name": "Premium Plan",
  "quantity": 1,
  "success_url": "http://localhost:8086/success",
  "cancel_url": "http://localhost:8086/cancel",
  "customer_email": "test@example.com",
  "billing_address": true,
  "metadata": {
    "order_id": "67890"
  }
}

### Test Missing Required Fields
POST http://localhost:8086/lms/v1/stripe/create-checkout-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 2000
}

### 3. Webhook Tests (Requires Stripe CLI)

# First run in terminal:
# stripe listen --forward-to http://localhost:8086/lms/v1/stripe/webhook

### Then trigger test events:
# stripe trigger payment_intent.succeeded
# stripe trigger payment_intent.payment_failed
# stripe trigger checkout.session.completed

### 4. Advanced Scenarios

### Test Different Currency (EUR)
POST http://localhost:8086/lms/v1/stripe/create-payment-intent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1500,
  "currency": "eur",
  "description": "EUR Test Payment"
}

### Test Complex Metadata
POST http://localhost:8086/lms/v1/stripe/create-payment-intent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 2000,
  "currency": "usd",
  "metadata": {
    "user_id": "user_789",
    "subscription": "annual",
    "custom_data": "special_value"
  }
}

### Test Recurring Payments
POST http://localhost:8086/lms/v1/stripe/create-checkout-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 2000,
  "currency": "usd",
  "product_name": "Monthly Subscription",
  "quantity": 1,
  "success_url": "http://localhost:8086/success",
  "cancel_url": "http://localhost:8086/cancel",
  "mode": "subscription"
}

